.( Loading Enumerates test...) cr#include enumerates.f83enumerates.( 1: Define a set of small numbers as enumerates and check their values) crenum.type SMALL.NUMBERS  enum ZERO  enum ONE  enum TWO  enum THREE  enum FOUR  enum FIVEenum.end  ZERO . ONE . TWO . THREE . FOUR . FIVE . cr.( 2: Define a set of operation code and give the values for each enumerate) crenum.type OP.CODES  10 >enum LOAD  15 >enum STORE  17 >enum ADD  21 >enum SUB  22 >enum MULenum.endLOAD . STORE . ADD . SUB . MUL . crforth only